## Navigating Creator Partnerships vs. AI Video Workflows

Working with human micro-influencers offers genuine personality, but comes with heavy operational baggage: product delivery delays, ghosting creators, and strict 30-day licensing limits.

### When to Use AI Video Generation:
- Rapid creative testing of new product concepts.
- High-volume localized variations for 10+ international markets.
- Unlimited perpetual commercial usage rights without recurring royalty fees.
